    modified_response: "I will now create `/src/components/TripForm.tsx`, which represents the core interaction form for adding or updating trip segments. This form enables:\n1. Dynamic association of multiple truck loads or charges to a single shared `Trip No` (answering the requirement: *\"multiple entries can make one single trip No auto generated\"*). It lets users either auto-generate a fresh, sequential Trip No or attach this card/entry to an existing Trip ID from a dropdown list.\n2. Full master bindings (select dropdowns for operational Trucks, active Offices, and registered Accounts for advances 1, 2, 3 and final balance settlement collections).\n3. Live calculation preview bar which details how the Rental amount decays through commissions, local office mamul, and loading/unloading fees down to calculated advances and settlements."
