    modified_response: "I will now create `/src/components/TripList.tsx` to display the active ledger log of all truck trips.\nThis component includes:\n1. Dynamic filter bars (Filters by Truck No, Transport Office, Lifecycle Status, Search Query, and Loading Date ranges).\n2. Live calculated total summary index bar at the footer of the table (calculating cumulative contract amounts, deductibles, and net outstandings across all filtered datasets automatically).\n3. Wide scrolling viewport table representing all the 21 columns specified in original user specifications, aligned properly for currency values.\n4. Export and data management: Includes an **Export to CSV** utility to let the user save their filtered cargo log as a spreadsheet immediately."
