    thinking: "**Verifying Compilation Success**\n\nThe applet compiled successfully! I\'ve confirmed the system build and that all features are live. I am now looking over constraints before proceeding. I am about to summarize the coding task.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built and configured the **Truck Trip Tracker** web application to replace manual tracking sheets.\n\n- **Types & Operational Logic** (`/src/types.ts`):\n  - Created strict interfaces matching your exact truck specifications, office branches, account ledgers, and 21-column shipment journals.\n  - Formulated a standard balance settlement calculation where `Balance = Rental - Freight Commission - Loading/Unloading Charges - Local Office Mamul - (Sum of up to 3 Advances)`.\n\n- **Primary Masters Registry System**:\n  - **Truck Fleet Datasheet** (`/src/components/TruckMaster.tsx`): Manage registration status, owner associations, primary drivers, and contact lines.\n  - **Transport Office Stations** (`/src/components/OfficeMaster.tsx`): Manage the broker branches and logistics hubs.\n  - **Financial Account Ledgers** (`/src/components/AccountMaster.tsx`): Manage banks, cash registers, and GPay numbers. These populate the dropdown panels to ensure every advance and final settlement is audited against active accounts.\n\n- **Dynamic Booking & Consolidation Engine** (`/src/components/TripForm.tsx`):\n  - Solves the core requirement: **\"multiple entries can make one single trip No auto generated\"**.\n  - On entry, the user can choose to **Auto-Generate a sequential Trip ID** (using the sequence `TRIP-YYYY-XXXX`) or **Associate with an Existing Trip ID**. Multiple entries can share the same Trip No, allowing seamless segment grouping.\n  - Embeds dropdown maps for trucks, offices, and accounts, with a dynamic calculations bar detailing net balance liabilities on typing.\n\n- **Audit Ledger Journal & Filters** (`/src/components/TripList.tsx`):\n  - Generates a wide-scrolled table containing all columns specified in your spreadsheet requirements.\n  - Provides advanced filters for searching text patterns, querying truck/office masters, checking settlement statuses, and filtering by loading date ranges.\n  - Includes a **Filtered Cumulative Totals Row** at the bottom of the table to show total contracts, deductibles, advances, and outstanding sums for the active search set.\n  - Integrates an **item-level Inspector Modal** to view all 21 columns in a clean layout, plus an **Export to CSV** utility to save the filtered dataset as a spreadsheet file.\n\n- **Executive Analytics Dashboard** (`/src/components/Dashboard.tsx`):\n  - Provides insight summaries, including current outstanding balances and operational recovery rates.\n  - Built custom, performant, responsive SVG gauges to illustrate collection rates and liability risk divisions by truck, completely in-browser.\n\n- **Coordinator & Backup Recovery Hub** (`/src/App.tsx`):\n  - Integrates tabs navigation framed by a professional space-dense dark theme.\n  - Utilizes `localStorage` for complete client-side data persistence. Includes preloaded demo entries to demonstrate grouping capabilities out of the box.\n  - Mounts a **Backup & Restore Utility** to export the entire truck database as a local `.json` file and restore it on other screens, preventing data loss.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 371255250
    }
