lass=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Received By (Account)</label>\\n            <select class=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-slate-50 focus:bg-white outline-none\\\">\\n              <option>Petty Cash - Jodhpur</option>\\n              <option>HDFC Business A/C</option>\\n              <option>Director Personal</option>\\n              <option>Fleet Manager Card</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Date Received</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"date\\\" value=\\\"2023-10-14\\\" class=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-slate-50 focus:bg-white outline-none\\\">\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"pt-4\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-100\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-xs mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">Loading Comm.</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"font-semibold\\\">\342\202\271800</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-xs mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">Unloading Chg.</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"font-semibold\\\">\342\202\2711,200</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-xs mb-1\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">Office Mamul</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"font-semibold\\\">\342\202\271500</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"h-px bg-slate-200 my-2\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-sm\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Calculated Balance</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"font-bold text-blue-700\\\">\342\202\27112,000</span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900 text-white py-3 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-slate-200\\\">\\n            Save Voucher\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex h-[768px] w-[1024px] overflow-hidden font-sans bg-slate-50\\\">\\n  <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 bg-slate-900 flex flex-col border-r border-slate-800\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-8 text-white font-bold text-xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM19 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\\\"></path>\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M13 16V6a1 1 0 00-1-1H4a1 1 0 00-1 1v10a1 1 0 001 1h1m8-1a1 1 0 01-1 1H9m4-1V8a1 1 0 011-1h2.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l3.414 3.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V16a1 1 0 01-1 1h-1m-6-1a1 1 0 00-1 1v1h2v-1a1 1 0 00-1-1z\\\"></path>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <span>FleetTrack Pro</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n          <span>Dashboard</span>\\n        </a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 font-medium rounded-lg\\\">\\n          <span>Trip Management</span>\\n        </a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white\\\">\\n          <span>Truck Registry</span>\\n        </a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white\\\">\\n          <span>Offices</span>\\n        </a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white\\\">\\n          <span>Account Ledger</span>\\n        </a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"mt-auto p-6 bg-slate-950\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\\\">Logged in as</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-200 font-medium\\\">Logistics Admin</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </aside>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col\\\">\\n    <!-- Header -->\\n    <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-bottom border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between px-8 shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800\\\">Manage Active Trips</h1>\\n        <span class=\\\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200\\\">128 Total Trips</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\\\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 shadow-sm\\\">\\n        + New Entry\\n      </button>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Quick Stats -->\\n    <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-6 p-6 shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Total Rental</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\342\202\2714,28,500</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Pending Balance</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-red-600\\\">\342\202\27185,420</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Active Office</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\\\">Main Jodhpur</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Account Sync</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-green-600\\\">Healthy</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Data Grid & Form Section -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 px-6 pb-6 overflow-hidden flex gap-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Recent Trips Table -->\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-4 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">Ongoing Shipments</span>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Filter Truck No...\\\" class=\\\"text-xs border rounded px-2 py-1 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none w-32\\\">\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-auto\\\">\\n          <table class=\\\"w-full text-left border-collapse\\\">\\n            <thead class=\\\"sticky top-0 bg-white shadow-sm\\\">\\n              <tr class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase border-b\\\">\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\\\">Truck No</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\\\">Trip ID</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\\\">Rental</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\\\">Loading Date</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\\\">Advances</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\\\">Balance</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\\\">Status</th>\\n              </tr>\\n            </thead>\\n            <tbody class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600\\\">\\n              <tr class=\\\"border-b hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4 font-mono font-medium text-slate-900\\\">RJ-14-GA-9022</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4\\\">TRP-2023-4402</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4 font-semibold\\\">45,000</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4\\\">14 Oct 2023</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"flex gap-1\\\">\\n                    <span class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full text-[8px] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">A1</span>\\n                    <span class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full text-[8px] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">A2</span>\\n                    <span class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-slate-200 rounded-full text-[8px] text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">A3</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4 text-red-600 font-bold tracking-tight\\\">12,000</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4\\\"><span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700 rounded text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\\\">In-Transit</span></td>\\n              </tr>\\n              <tr class=\\\"border-b hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4 font-mono font-medium text-slate-900\\\">MH-12-PQ-1221</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4\\\">TRP-2023-4403</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4 font-semibold\\\">38,500</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4\\\">12 Oct 2023</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-4\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"flex gap-1\\\">\\n                    <span class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-green-500 rounded-full text-[8px] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">A1</span>\\n                    <span class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-slate-200 rounded-full text-[8px] text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">A2</span>\\n                    <span class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-slate-200 rounded-full text-[8px] text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">A3</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </td>\\n           