\n\n**Calculating Expenses Aggressively**\n\nI\'m now implementing the calculation logic for aggregating trip expenses. I\'m prioritizing defensive programming with fallback calculations to handle missing parent values. I\'m focusing on ensuring all expenses are summed correctly, especially fuel-related and other trip-level costs.\n\n\n"
