arting and ending kilometers, trip status, and trip notes. I\'m also ensuring the fuel, sub-trips, and payment data are loaded, too. Finally, I\'ve loaded the \'master trip common expenses\' details. If the form is open, but the data is fresh, the first available truck is set as default.\n\n\n**Synchronizing Diesel Calculation**\n\nI\'m now implementing dynamic updates for common expenses, specifically for diesel calculations. I\'ve updated the `useEffect` hook to ensure the `dieselAmount` automatically updates whenever `dieselLiters` or `dieselRate` changes, maintaining data consistency. This will prevent inconsistencies and require less manual adjustment in the form.\n\n\n"
